!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! File_Save_As is used to save the workspace using the WKS_FOLDER location. Make sure the SUBJ folder is 
! created prior to running of the script. The folder will not self create on running this script.
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
File_Save_As
/FILE_NAME=&::WKS_FOLDER&&::SUBJ&\&::SUBJ&.cmz
! /SET_PROMPT=Save CMO file as
! /SAVE_EMBEDDED_GRAPHICS=FALSE
;

!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! The process is repeated for the next SUBJ specified or will end.  
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
End_For_Each
/ITERATION_PARAMETER_NAME=SUBJ
;

